口 图谱模式</div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="920" y="60" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">16:9 窗口 图谱模式</text></switch></g></g><g data-cell-id="26"><g><path d="M 815 172.5 L 888.63 172.5" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-miterlimit="10" pointer-events="stroke" style="stroke: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"/><path d="M 893.88 172.5 L 886.88 176 L 888.63 172.5 L 886.88 169 Z" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-miterlimit="10" pointer-events="all" style="fill: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); stroke: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"/></g></g><g data-cell-id="24"><g><ellipse cx="792.5" cy="172.5" rx="22.5" ry="22.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000000" pointer-events="all" style="fill: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); stroke: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"/></g></g><g data-cell-id="25"><g><ellipse cx="917.5" cy="172.5" rx="22.5" ry="22.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000000" pointer-events="all" style="fill: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); stroke: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"/></g></g><g data-cell-id="27"><g><path d="M 740 270 L 760 290 L 740 310 L 720 290 Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000000" stroke-miterlimit="10" pointer-events="all" style="fill: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); stroke: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 38px; height: 1px; padding-top: 290px; margin-left: 721px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: center; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; ">q</div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="740" y="294" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">q</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="28"><g><path d="M 797 270 L 817 290 L 797 310 L 777 290 Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000000" stroke-miterlimit="10" pointer-events="all" style="fill: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); stroke: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 38px; height: 1px; padding-top: 290px; margin-left: 778px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: center; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; ">w</div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="797" y="294" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">w</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="29"><g><rect x="800" y="220" width="120" height="60" rx="9" ry="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000000" pointer-events="all" style="fill: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); stroke: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 118px; height: 1px; padding-top: 250px; margin-left: 801px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: center; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; ">鼠标悬浮工具提示</div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="860" y="254" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">鼠标悬浮工具提示</text></switch></g></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="22"><g><rect x="720" y="350" width="180" height="280" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe flex-start; justify-content: unsafe flex-start; width: 178px; height: 1px; padding-top: 357px; margin-left: 722px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: left; max-height: 276px; overflow: hidden; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; "><h1 style="margin-top: 0px;">教学引导</h1><p>提示用户打开图谱模式</p><p>看到虚线变成实线箭头，表示原因→期待（因为爱吃肉，所以期待听到铃声）</p><p>提示用q技能触发铃声</p><p>看到<span style="background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));">铃声出现在工作记忆里，然后</span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));">铃声节点会将信号沿着实线传播，到达食欲节点，并沿着食欲节点到达流口水的狗基因节点</span></p><p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));">引导关闭图谱模式，看到狗贴图播放流口水动画</span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));">，然后播放 galgame 对话</span></p></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="722" y="369" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px">教学引导提示用户打开图谱模式看到虚线变成实线箭头，表示原因→期待（因为爱吃肉，所以期待听到铃声）提示用q技能触发铃声...</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="23"><g><rect x="940" y="350" width="340" height="310" fill="none" stroke="none" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe flex-start; justify-content: unsafe flex-start; width: 338px; height: 1px; padding-top: 357px; margin-left: 942px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: left; max-height: 306px; overflow: hidden; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; "><h1 style="margin-top: 0px;">继续游戏</h1><p>此时已经介绍了所需的基础操作，玩家可以继续自己操作，阅读巴普诺夫的狗的后续剧情，也可以直接退出，玩别的剧本</p><p>播放剧情，试验了不同速度的节拍器，告诉玩家可以这样玩</p><p>玩家可以对狗使用不同速度的节拍器，观察到复用了图谱里现有的节拍器听觉节点，并触发流口水</p><p>如果不给予食物，狗会尽可能保持现有的节点，并产生新的40次慢节奏节拍听觉节点，产生红色的虚线，表示抑制。并在多次后变成红色箭头，表示很不想看到（因为爱吃肉，所以很不想听到慢节拍器）</p><p>播放慢节拍器时，会同时激活抽象的节拍器节点，以及新的慢节拍器节点，它们产生的信号会正好抵消。所以狗不流口水。</p><p>可以无条件给狗吃肉，每次直接激活底层节点，都会削弱到后续节点连接的强度，直到完全忘记。但会和看到巴普诺夫的视觉节点产生联系。</p></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="942" y="369" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px">继续游戏此时已经介绍了所需的基础操作，玩家可以继续自己操作，阅读巴普诺夫的狗的后续剧情，也可以直接退出，玩别的剧本播放剧情，试验了不同速度的节拍器，告诉玩家可以这样玩玩家可以对狗使用不同速度的节拍器，观察到复用了图谱里现有的节拍器听觉节点，并触发流口水如果不给予食物，狗会尽可能保持现有的节点，并产生新的40次慢节奏节拍听觉节点，产生红色的虚线，表示抑制。并在多次后变成红色箭头，表示很不想看到（因为爱吃肉，所以很不想听到慢节拍器）...</text></switch></g></g></g></g></g></g><switch><g requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"/><a transform="translate(0,-5)" xlink:href="https://www.drawio.com/doc/faq/svg-export-text-problems" target="_blank"><text text-anchor="middle" font-size="10px" x="50%" y="100%">Text is not SVG - cannot display</text></a></switch></svg>